'' TWO MODULES THAT BOTH USE A TYPE WITH A VIRTUAL METHOD LINK. Each emits the
'' type's vtable (_ZTV) and RTTI record (_ZTS); fbc makes both module-local ('static',
'' llvm-nm 'd', measured 2026-09-26) and tiko emitted them strong, so this pair failed
'' with "lld-link: duplicate symbol: vtable for B" and "typeinfo name for B".
''
'' The runner cannot run what it builds, so the link is the assertion; the program's
'' output -- dispatch and 'is D' tested in the module that did NOT create the object,
'' and the other way round -- was checked by hand against fbc's, and the internal
'' linkage is pinned in IR by vtable-internal.test.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/driver/src/vtable-two-a.bas tests/driver/src/vtable-two-b.bas -o tests/driver/vtabletwo.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: duplicate symbol
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/driver/vtabletwo.exe
